[341.575921, "o", "\u001b[0m# \u001b[0mTodos\r\n[✓] Milestone 0: ground truth (mvn test, 13 green, show smell)\r\n[✓] Milestone 1 EXPAND: ItemUpdater + 4 abstract rule classes, tests green\r\n[✓] Milestone 2 MIGRATE AgedBrie: move_method + rename + stub, tests green\r\n[✓] Milestone 2 MIGRATE BackstagePass: move_method + rename + stub, tests green\r\n[✓] Milestone 2 MIGRATE Sulfuras: move_method + rename + stub, tests green\r\n[✓] Milestone 2 MIGRATE Regular: move_method + rename + stub, tests green\r\n[✓] Milestone 3 CONTRACT step 1: chain with dead stubs, tests green\r\n[✓] Milestone 3 CONTRACT step 2: remove 4 dead stubs with remove_method, tests green\r\n[✓] Epilogue: prove equivalence, trace item through chain\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
