[347.081294, "o", "**Migration complete — all 13 tests green.**\r\n\r\n**The trace** (`apply` walk in `GildedRose.java:25`):\r\n- **Aged Brie** → `AgedBrieUpdater.canHandle` answers true (`\"Aged Brie\".equals(item.name)`) → its `update` runs → return.\r\n- **A normal item** (e.g. \"+5 Dexterity Vest\") → AgedBrie/Backstage/Sulfuras all say no → falls to the always-true `RegularUpdater` tail.\r\n\r\nThe \"kitchen sink\" is now a clean chain of responsibility: `ItemUpdater` + four `final` rule classes, while the golden master proves byte-identical behavior from start (76-line if/else `GildedRose`) to finish (23 lines, zero business logic).\r\n\r\nSession scores: EXPAND once green, MIGRATE green after each of the four types, CONTRACT green with-and-without dead stubs, and a final `mvn test` → `Tests run: 13, Failures: 0`.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
